    <description
  >Portfolio contact form follow up (content drafts section 2, ADR-031). When a Lead arrives from the form, the owner gets a custom notification on the desktop and in the mobile app. Scheduled paths run at Reply Reminder 1 At and Reply Reminder 2 At, the one and two business day times LeadReminderService works out, and remind the owner only while the Lead keeps its starting status, is not spam and is not converted.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel
  >Lead Contact Form Reminders {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
